Tide Watch 2 is an independent continuation of signalk-tide-watch by Joel Kozikowski.
Original upstream: https://github.com/joelkoz/signalk-tide-watch
Original baseline commit: 3436d24189441a484a3c9dbbab137ef657860f39
License: ISC

The source baseline for this release is the user's installed 1.2.1 build, copied
from TBD. OriginalPlugin.js, TideAnalysis.js, DBDepthLog.js and LocationManager.js
are unchanged from that installed build. OriginalPlugin.js includes the previously
introduced source-less depth-input compatibility guard; that guard is retained.

Independent display changes by SCarns, 2026: offline history chart, smoothing,
units, themes and presentation adapter. Version 1.3.0 adds configurable 2–6-hour
display smoothing, an icon, request handling fixes and independent release metadata.
No tide prediction or detection rule is changed in 1.3.0.
